{"id": "blend-omninodes-norm01", "name": "OmniNodes blend with per-channel 0..1 windowing", "family": "latent", "subfamily": "blend", "plain": "Image-style modes done properly for a signed range: each channel is rescaled to 0..1, blended, then mapped back to a's range. Strength multiplies the output, except in add and subtract, where it scales b. Lerp, add, subtract and difference stay raw. This is a different and more defensible way to apply screen or overlay than the raw-value tables.", "math": "an=(a\u2212min)/(max\u2212min+1e\u22128) per sample and channel; bn same\nscreen: 1\u2212(1\u2212an)(1\u2212bn); overlay: an<0.5 ? 2an\u00b7bn : 1\u22122(1\u2212an)(1\u2212bn)\nout=denorm(lerp(an,blend,ratio), range of a)\u00b7strength", "props": {"operates_on": "LATENT 4D", "params": "blend_mode, ratio=0.5, strength=1.0, normalize_output=False, mask"}, "evidence": [{"where": "TensorVizion__OmniNodes/Latent Nodes/latent_blend_node.py:54", "symbol": "def _norm01"}, {"where": "TensorVizion__OmniNodes/Latent Nodes/latent_blend_node.py:100", "symbol": "_denorm"}], "providers": [{"pack": "TensorVizion__OmniNodes", "author": "TensorVizion", "licence": "Apache-2.0", "kind": "original", "nodes": ["LatentBlendNode"], "note": "", "verdict": "TRY", "risks": ["installs software at runtime", "paid or partner API", "downloads models"], "res4lyf": false}, {"pack": "mozhaa__ComfyUI-Latent-Transform", "author": "mozhaa", "licence": "none-found", "kind": "variant", "nodes": ["LTBlend"], "note": "name only", "verdict": "TRY", "risks": [], "res4lyf": false}, {"pack": "Machines-of-Disruption__latent-tools", "author": "Machines-of-Disruption", "licence": "MIT", "kind": "variant", "nodes": ["LTBlendLatent"], "note": "name only", "verdict": "", "risks": [], "res4lyf": false}, {"pack": "flyingshutter__As_ComfyUI_CustomNodes", "author": "flyingshutter", "licence": "GPL", "kind": "variant", "nodes": ["LatentMix_AS", "LatentMixMasked_As"], "note": "name only", "verdict": "SKIP", "risks": ["runs decod